  "region_id": "cn-southwest-2",
  "paths": {
    "/v1/core/code-interpreters": {
      "get": {
        "x-request-examples-url-1": "GET /v1/core/code-interpreters?name=demo",
        "x-api-type": "open-api",
        "x-support-sdk": "Y",
        "x-is-registered": "Y",
        "x-api-service-plane": "Control-plane",
        "x-sec-data-level": "L1",
        "x-api-framework": "RestfulAPI",
        "x-api-user": "IAM普通租户",
        "x-iam-auth-meta-anno": {
          "abacAction": "agentarts:codeInterpreter:listCoreCodeInterpreters",
          "authLevel": "NO_INSTANCE",
          "needResourceTagCheck": false,
          "needApigwJwtAuthCheck": true,
          "needAbacCheck": true,
          "needAbacResourceCheck": false,
          "supportAllGrantedEps": false,
          "needRbacCheck": true,
          "needCbcCheck": true,
          "opType": "guessByHttpMethod",
          "model": "v5",
          "authContextInitializerName": "defaultIamAuthContextInitializer"
        },
        "tags": [
          "代码解释器管理"
        ],
        "summary": "查询代码解释器列表",
        "description": "该API用于查询代码解释器列表。",
        "operationId": "ListCoreCodeInterpreters",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "name",
            "in": "query",
            "description": "**参数解释:**\n按代码解释器名称过滤。\n**约束范围:**\n不涉及\n**取值范围:**\n长度在2到40之间\n**默认取值:**\n空",
            "required": false,
            "type": "string",
            "minLength": 2,
            "maxLength": 40
          },
          {
            "$ref": "#/parameters/Offset"
          },
          {
            "$ref": "#/parameters/Limit"
          },
          {
            "name": "sort_key",
            "in": "query",
            "required": false,
            "description": "**参数解释:**\n排序字段\n**约束范围:**\n不涉及\n**取值范围:**\n必须是created_at或updated_at\n**默认取值:**\n缺省值为created_at",
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "created_at",
              "updated_at"
            ],
            "default": "created_at"
          },
          {
            "name": "sort_dir",
            "in": "query",
            "required": false,
            "description": "**参数解释:**\n排序方向\n**约束范围:**\n不涉及\n**取值范围:**\n必须是asc或desc\n**默认取值:**\n缺省值为desc",
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "asc",
              "desc"
            ],
            "default": "desc"
          },
          {
            "name": "tag_key_exists",
            "in": "query",
            "description": "**参数解释**: \n需要匹配的包含该标签名称的资源, 多个值通过重复参数名传递,如:tag_key_exists=env&tag_key_exists=team。\n**约束限制**:\n支持批量查询多个标签名,最多支持10个标签。\n**取值范围**:\n最小数量 1,最大数量 10\n**默认取值**:\n不涉及。",
            "required": false,
            "type": "string",
            "collectionFormat": "multi"
          },
          {
            "name": "tag_key_matches",
            "in": "query",
            "description": "**参数解释**: \n需要匹配的包含该标签的资源,需要和tag_value_matches条件配合使用,tag_key_matches和tag_value_matches的元素个数需要一致,且标签顺序需要完全匹配,不支持空字符串, 如:tag_key_matches=env&tag_key_matches=team。\n**约束限制**:\n支持批量查询多个标签,最多支持10个标签。tag_key_matches和tag_value_matches键值对不可重复.\n**取值范围**:\n最小数量 1,最大数量 10\n**默认取值**:\n不涉及。",
            "required": false,
            "type": "string",
            "collectionFormat": "multi"
          },
          {
            "name": "tag_value_matches",
            "in": "query",
            "description": "**参数解释**: \n需要匹配的包含该标签的资源,需要和tag_key_matches条件配合使用,tag_key_matches和tag_value_matches的元素个数需要一致,且标签顺序需要完全匹配,支持空字符串,  如:tag_key_matches=env&tag_value_matches=prod。\n**约束限制**:\n支持批量查询多个标签,最多支持10个标签。tag_key_matches和tag_value_matches键值对不可重复.\n**取值范围**:\n最小数量 1,最大数量 10\n**默认取值**:\n不涉及。",
            "required": false,
            "type": "string",
            "collectionFormat": "multi"
          },
          {
            "name": "tag_match_policy",
            "in": "query",
            "description": "**参数解释**:\n标签匹配模式,仅针对tag_key_exists,tag_key_matches,tag_value_matches参数生效。\n- ALL: 若请求中包含tag_key_exists参数,查询规则为资源标签需要包含tag_key_exists中的所有元素,若请求中tag_key_matches以及tag_value_matches参数存在,查询规则为资源标签需要包含所有tag_key_matches以及tag_value_matches参数中指定的key-value对应的标签。\n三个参数都存在时,取tag_key_exists和tag_key_matches,tag_value_matches的交集 \n- ANY: 若请求中包含tag_key_exists参数,查询规则为资源标签需要包含tag_key_exists中的任意一个元素,若请求中tag_key_matches以及tag_value_matches参数存在,查询规则为资源标签需要包含tag_key_matches以及tag_value_matches参数中任意一个key-value对应的标签。\n三个参数都存在时,取tag_key_exists和tag_key_matches,tag_value_matches的并集\n**约束限制**:\n不涉及。\n**取值范围**:\n长度为1-3个字符。允许的值为:\n- ALL\n- ANY\n**默认取值**:\nALL",
            "required": false,
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "ALL",
              "ANY"
            ],
            "default": "ALL"
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "OK。",
            "schema": {
              "$ref": "#/definitions/ListCoreCodeInterpretersResponseBody"
            },
            "examples": {
              "application/json": {
                "items": [
                  {
                    "id": "386ab51c-aaa0-xxxx-xxxx-60243a1e22fa",
                    "name": "asfasfasf",
                    "description": "zxvbzxb",
